{"ref":"BDB, גָּזָם","hw":"גָּזָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזָם</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Amos 4:9\" href=\"/Amos.4.9\">Am 4:9</a></sup> <strong>locusts</strong> (coll.)—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:4\" href=\"/Joel.1.4\">Jo 1:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:25\" href=\"/Joel.2.25\">2:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:9\" href=\"/Amos.4.9\">Am 4:9</a>;—always as devouring, devastating, <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:4\" href=\"/Joel.1.4\">Jo 1:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבֶּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶלֶק</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסִיל</span>), <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:25\" href=\"/Joel.2.25\">2:25</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:9\" href=\"/Amos.4.9\">Am 4:9</a> alone: <em>your gardens and your vineyards, and your fig-trees and your olive-trees</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹאכַל הַגָּזָם</span>.","next":"BDB, גַּזָּם","prev":"BDB, גזם"}